tItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4833220,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4833220-1845383656379806","game_id":"steam-4833220","kind":"announcement","title":"The Dojo & Werewolf’s Den Are Here!","summary":"Hey everyone!Our latest major update is live! Train your heroes in the new Dojo, experiment with talent builds, and take your party into Werewolf’s Den. We’ve also reworked expeditions, equipment, and progression—and added more story moments along the way.A new dungeon: Werewolf’s DenDefeated the Minotaur? Your next challenge awaits.Werewolf’s Den takes your party into a snowy dungeon filled with wolves, ranged enemies, and a new boss: the Werewolf. Bring your best equipment, prepare your talent","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T05:05:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379806","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4833220-1841579228674080","game_id":"steam-4833220","kind":"announcement","title":"We've reached 2,000 wishlists!","summary":"Hello, heroes!Today we have a very special reason to celebrate: My Own Hero Party has reached 2,000 wishlists on Steam! 🎉Everyone who added the game to their wishlist helped us get here. Seeing so many people interested in the project is a huge motivation for us to keep working, improving its systems, and building an increasingly fun experience.There is still plenty of work to do and lots of news ahead. We will keep sharing development updates, new content, and everything we are preparing for th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T21:27:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228674080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4833220-1841579228665546","game_id":"steam-4833220","kind":"update","title":"New Update: More Control and a Special Surprise","summary":"🪙 Collect Coins with Your CursorYou can now collect coins scattered around the battlefield simply by hovering your cursor over them.🎯 Prioritize Your TargetsClick directly on a mob to make it your party’s priority target.🔥 Minotaur Mage Skill ReworkedWe’ve refactored the Minotaur Mage’s skill to improve how it works during combat.🥚 A Special SurpriseWe have a surprise for players who complete the first dungeon using only the Warrior. No spoilers—good luck!Thank you to everyone playing and sharin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T13:28:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228665546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4833220-1840310314352747","game_id":"steam-4833220","kind":"announcement","title":"The Arsenal is OPEN! ⚔️","summary":"Heroes, clear some inventory space: the Arsenal is officially open!Sakasmith has spent far too long surrounded by hammers, sparks, and questionable safety decisions. The result? A new place to find gear, power up your party, and turn “We almost had them!” into “Wait… where did the boss go?”Stop by the Arsenal, check out the goods, and prepare your party for the next expedition.Just don’t ask Sakasmith why some of the weapons are still warm. 🔥🔨","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T23:01:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314352747","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:47:34Z","discovery_method":"official_